# Device screenshots and recordings are evidence, not source. A 1.78 MB
# orphaned screenshot sat committed at the repo root (54% of all tracked
# bytes) with zero references anywhere. Keep evidence in blueprints/ when it
# belongs to a record; keep scratch captures out of git.
Screenshot_*.png
screenshot_*.png
*.mp4
*.mov

# Root .gitignore had no node_modules entry - it was only covered by
# .opencode/.gitignore, so any new npm dep elsewhere would be committed.
node_modules/
